    "detailed_description": "<h1>Content Creation &amp; Streaming Guidelines</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create and stream content as long as you include a link to the store page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no copyrighted music or AI-generated content.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Insider Trading</strong></i><strong> is a stock-themed roguelite deckbuilder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><strong>With endless builds and game-breaking synergies, it will give you the experience of wrecking the market.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Cards Dictate the Market</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/3a86eaaf7312a92179a97983c3dbde0f.poster.avif?t=1749977863\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/3a86eaaf7312a92179a97983c3dbde0f.webm?t=1749977863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/3a86eaaf7312a92179a97983c3dbde0f.mp4?t=1749977863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/ed4e0a9cc8ab0a4a799ca91c630e05a7.poster.avif?t=1749977863\" width=800 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/ed4e0a9cc8ab0a4a799ca91c630e05a7.webm?t=1749977863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/ed4e0a9cc8ab0a4a799ca91c630e05a7.mp4?t=1749977863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the market with the power of your cards.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart generation will be in your hands as long as you strategically play out your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the ultimate combo that will push the market to insanity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Define your Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/0972b6c3517bf99a5440cb6c17083ccd.poster.avif?t=1749977863\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/0972b6c3517bf99a5440cb6c17083ccd.webm?t=1749977863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/0972b6c3517bf99a5440cb6c17083ccd.mp4?t=1749977863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add cards, remove cards, and upgrade cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card has a synergizing type and a unique effect that will suggest a new strategy each run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Possibilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/92fbfd1317a11ced3f82e3d861e37cd1.poster.avif?t=1749977863\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/92fbfd1317a11ced3f82e3d861e37cd1.webm?t=1749977863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166810/extras/92fbfd1317a11ced3f82e3d861e37cd1.mp4?t=1749977863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your build to the moon with\u00a0infinitely stackable\u00a0<strong>Perks</strong>\u00a0and<strong> Events</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your power grow exponentially as you progress deeper into the market.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's All About the Money</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment, have fun, and make the market yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and dive into the rhythmic flow of charts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a hand-crafted design by the solo-developer, <i>Insider Trading</i>\u00a0will give you an immersive, satisfying experience.</p>",
